## The problem

Cinema customers need to see seats disappear the moment someone else books them, and payments must never double-sell a seat.

## How it works

- **Real-time seat maps.** WebSockets push availability changes to every open session.
- **Booking APIs.** RESTful endpoints for authentication, seat allocation, payments and booking workflows, integrated with Stripe and handling 1,000+ daily transactions.
- **Performance.** Query tuning with SQLAlchemy plus Redis caching cut API response times by 25%.

## Delivery

Containerised with Docker and deployed on AWS EC2, with automated build, test and deploy pipelines in GitHub Actions. The platform serves 10,000+ monthly users.
